WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.527
In this course, practice is the product.

00:00:02.527 --> 00:00:03.971
Watching is not finishing.

00:00:03.971 --> 00:00:06.858
This lesson is about how quizzes unlock progress.

00:00:06.858 --> 00:00:09.385
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:09.385 --> 00:00:12.995
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:18.409
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:18.409 --> 00:00:22.380
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.072
Stay practical: explain why quizzes gate progress before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:28.496
Quizzes force retrieval.

00:00:28.496 --> 00:00:32.912
You prove you can use the idea, not just recognize the words.

00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:35.856
Remember the objective: explain why quizzes gate progress.

00:00:35.856 --> 00:00:39.904
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:39.904 --> 00:00:44.320
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.368
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:52.784
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:54.961
Progress unlocks when you pass.

00:00:54.961 --> 00:00:58.676
That gate protects you from bingeing and calling it work.

